window.products.push({"id":217064,"name":"Smithcraft Professional Knife Sharpener for Straight and Serrated Knives, 2 Stage Tungsten steel and Diamond Coated Sharpening Wheel System for Steel,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EE4Lr4r0L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Introducing The Smithcraft Diamond Knife Sharpening System 1.We use a 2 wheel sharpening system that creates a double bevelled edge on your knife. This type of edge is not only super sharp but because of the way it is created the edge on your blade, the sharpness stays longer, much longer. 2.We also use the finest parts and there is no better sharpening substance than diamond. 3.Your new Smithcraft Diamond Knife Sharpener is the perfect tool for keeping all of those kitchen, utility, pocket  and hunting knives in top shape.  4.The first wheel is diamond coated coarse sharpening section will shape your knife into a double edge finish,  an edge that lasts much longer than your current sharpener. The second wheel on the Smithcraft Diamond Knife Sharpener is a premium quality ceramic wheel system. This section  is designed to hone the knife, repairing any small nicks or imperfections from your edge. Easy To Use: STEP 1: Coarse sharpening: Place knife on the sharpening slot. Using light pressure pull the blade back in a horizontal  motion, drawing the blade through the slot from base to tip. Repeat this motion 2-3 times. Don’t push and/or forcefully  pull the knife back and forth. STEP 2: Fine honing: This necessary step eliminates the burrs on the knife as well as returning the knife to optimum  sharpness with a polished look. Honing your knife should be done regularly dependent on use. Remark: 1.This product is not suitable for grinding scissors, ceramic knife.  2.Do not use too much force for sharpening motions. Do not pull your knife back and forth in the grinder slots,  or you will damage the blade.  3.Do not put the sharpener in a dishwasher or rinse in water. If for any reason you are not fully satisfied, just return it and we will give you a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EE4Lr4r0L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smithcraft","source_asin":"B076BRYJ9L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217064","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076BRYJ9L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076BRYJ9L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
