window.products.push({"id":217098,"name":"DRKIO Regular Mouth Canning Lids - 218 Pcs Mason Jar Lids and Extra 10 Bands 100% Fit For Ball Kerr Jars Food Grade Material Split-Type Metal Canning ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CEOvWPubL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[228PCS GREAT VALUE SET]: Are you still using expensive or incompatible canning lids? Now it's time to have better ones! Our set includes 218 regular mouth canning lids(70 mm/2.76 in), replace rusty and aging lids at any time, and Extra 10 canning bands, you can start your canning journey immediately without an additional purchase; Best of all, 100% compatible fit with all regular mouth glass mason jars including Ball and Kerr! [DURABLE & WIDE APPLICABILITY]: No one likes rust-prone mason jar lids. Our lids are made of high-quality tinplate and have excellent corrosion resistance in daily use while can withstand high and low temperatures, perfect for water bath jar, pressure jar and refrigerator storage, etc., providing you with a first-class use experience. [100% SAFE & LEAK-FREE]: With food-grade silicone sealing ring that does not contain harmful substances such as BPA, has excellent airtightness. The safety button on the top of the canning lids with humanized design will sink after cooking, allows you to easily know the status of the seal and ensure the sealing effect. Absolutely the best choice for your food preparation or storage. [CONVENIENT & MULTIPURPOSE]: Design the top of the canning jar lids with the date or name of the food that can be recorded, you can make jams, drinks, pickles with confidence, and share these delicacies with your family anytime without forgetting and losing them. You can even let your imagination run wild and make these lids into unique family or Christmas crafts, ideal for gifts! [100% SATISFACTION WITH NO WORRIES]: If you have any questions or are dissatisfied with our regular canning lids, please feel free to contact us and we will reply to you within 24 hours. We’re not just sure that you will love these regular mouth canning lids, we're truly dedicated to your 100% satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CEOvWPubL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DRKIO","source_asin":"B09ZSRQQ85","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZSRQQ85","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZSRQQ85","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":217099,"name":"Tenergy Solis Digital Meat Thermometer, APP Controlled Wireless Bluetooth Smart BBQ Thermometer w/ 2 Stainless Steel Probes, Large LCD Display, & Carr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y3YY2RdoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Accurate high temp readings - The next generation of cooking is here with the Tenergy Bluetooth meat thermometer for grilling. Capable of giving readings between 32°F - 572°F, it delivers a +/-1% accuracy level to ensure precise temperatures each time. It is designed with an easy-to-read large black lit LCD screen. Whether its meat, poultry, fish, bread, candy, frying oil, coffee or home brewing, get the all-purpose kitchen thermometer, Tenergy Solis. Smart real-time notifications - Free yourself from cooking as you can get instant notifications through your phone with Tenergy’s meat thermometer Bluetooth to phone. Get temperature readings on your phone via Bluetooth with a range of up to 100ft using the smart App (Search for Solis Thermo Android Google Play only). Cooking isn’t convenient, but Tenergy Solis Bluetooth smoker thermometer just made it be. Easy-to-use app - The App available on both Apple iOS and Android Play store has a simple to use interface that allows you to choose from 11 (beef, veal, lamb, pork, chicken, turkey, fish, hamburger, BBQ Smoke, Hot Smoke, Cold Smoke) pre-set temperatures based on the protein that you are cooking. Customize the temperatures based on your personal preferences and impress your pitmaster friends with Bluetooth grilling thermometer and consistent doness each grill. Multitasking made simple - The Tenergy Bluetooth meat probe thermometer for smoker comes with 2 probes that are stainless steel with a BPA-free silicon handle. The probes connecting wire is crafted with metal braiding with an upgraded internal Teflon core capable of withstanding up to 716°F, making it an industry leading tough design. The device and app supports uses of up to 6 probes to go from simple BBQ monitoring to multi-meat tasking. Backed with CE certification and a Tenergy 2-year extended warranty when you register your Solis kitchen thermometer. Includes Tenergy branded batteries for optimal performance! Probe malfunctions caused by improper use may happen, we will provide replacement probe free of charge. WARNING: Please DO NOT leave probes in oven when temperature is set to above 482°F.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y3YY2RdoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tenergy","source_asin":"B07812BPZM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07812BPZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07812BPZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
