window.products.push({"id":217104,"name":"Laura Ashley 4x4 Silver Beveled Mirror Picture Frame, Classic Mirrored Frame with Deep Slanted Angle, Wall-Mountable, Made for Tabletop Display, Photo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ip3Zmc1kL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This gorgeous Laura Ashley beveled mirror frame is a charming accent to any interior space that will do more than just display your favorite photos. The understated elegance to these frames is strikingly evident in its design. The mirrored finish to this attractive frame reflects light, providing a welcome illumination to the inviting atmosphere you want to cozy up in. The feeling created by seeing your memories displayed in stunning and classic style may fill you with a sense of warmth. The shimmering, slanted mirror is surrounded with a piping border on its outer and inner edges, creating the “pop out” effect that draws the eye to the beauty in your portrait shots. The distressed metallic look of the borders gives off a vintage allure that will make the history in black-and-white photos seem to come alive. When viewed from a shelf on a side angle, the brushed, metallic look of the edges recalls a sense of timeless familiarity. This pretty frame has a surprisingly sturdy feel to it that stands out when you hold it, helping the moment or memory preserved inside it attract attention. Rest this frame vertically or horizontally on any desk or shelf and enjoy the delightful touch of style it adds to any space. It has a rich black velvet back with a firm 2-way easel to match. Hanging tabs are attached, allowing it to be beautifully mounted on a wall either vertically or horizontally. Decorating your blank walls with these chic frames can turn your living room or office into your own personal art gallery. A series of cityscape photos displayed on a wall may breathe new life into your living space. Share the joy these decorative frames bring you with your friends, family, and co-workers, as they make a thoughtful gift for the holidays or any season.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ip3Zmc1kL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laura Ashley","source_asin":"B082YF7C44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082YF7C44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082YF7C44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
