window.products.push({"id":217241,"name":"DFOONO 70 inch Royal Blue Round Tablecloth- Stain and Wrinkle Resistant Washable Circular Table Cloth, Polyester Fabric Table Cover for Banquet, Dinin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cgsQI3X+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What can your tablecloth do for your décor? Clean tables are a mark of a well-kept home. Whether your coverings are ornamental or simple and sturdy, a good tablecloth will protect your surfaces and create a spotless canvas for your table setting. Table linens can also help convey the theme of your event or occasion. For example, solid colors are a staple of fine dining, while bold prints and patterns can liven up a cozy home. Your tablecloth will bear the weight of your guests’ attentions, as well as the odd spilled drink or two. That’s why you need to find an elegant tablecloth that is durable enough for daily use and special occasions, too! Set the right mood and atmosphere with DFOONO Round Tablecloths! These round tablecloths are pleasantly thick and require minimal effort to maintain. They’re cut from heavy-duty polyester fabric, a common material for table linens used in cafes and casual dining restaurants. They’re tough, absorbent, and incredibly easy to clean - just one round in the machine will have them looking fresh and new! Any stubborn wrinkles will be easy to iron out, and you never have to worry about shrinking or fading colors. Choose from solid pink, purple, peach, and blue to suit your preferences. Our tablecloths are available in 60-inch, 70-inch, 90-inch, and 120-inch versions. To find the size you need, add two times the drop length you prefer to the length of your table’s diameter. Still not convinced? Here are more important details about our premium polyester tablecloths! Perfect for indoor and outdoor events - Smooth, thick, strong against snags - Iron at low temperatures - Do not bleach - Hand or machine wash in cold water Celebrate fine dining in a whole new way. Add the DFOONO Round Tablecloths to your cart TODAY.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cgsQI3X+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DFOONO","source_asin":"B0B324DWQN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B324DWQN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B324DWQN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
