window.products.push({"id":217440,"name":"Caviar Spoon, Pure Silver Band & Mother of Pearl – 3” L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fK-JbS2OL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This original design from Perla Spoon created by Jean Claude Lair, brings “etiquette” to another level. It highlights and preserves flavor. The silver band is made strictly from 100%, .925, American-grade silver. The silver gently compliments the iridescent ribbons running throughout the creamy, mother of pearl spoon. Made of purely organic materials and designed exclusively in San Francisco, California, it bears the insignia of Perla Spoon. Accept no imitations. TIP—To truly embrace the simple elegance of caviar, follow these simple steps. Use a mother of pearl spoon to gently scoop the beads of caviar. Place them on the tip of your tongue. Next, simply press the tip of your tongue against the back of your palate, and experience the rush of flavor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fK-JbS2OL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ocean Mother Pearl Spoon","source_asin":"B00AR87792","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217440","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AR87792","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AR87792","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
