window.products.push({"id":217534,"name":"EpiqueOne 30-Piece Rainbow Party Decoration Kit | Create a Splash with a Rainbow of Colors in Your Celebrations | Easy to Assemble | for Birthdays, Br","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81A04u56LGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY TO ASSEMBLE: With just a few minutes spent fluffing up our vibrant tissue paper pom poms, your event will begin to come alive. Our kit contains lightweight paper lanterns and honeycomb balls that can be easily opened and assembled in seconds with no hassles. This ultimate party decor set is designed to be user-friendly, hassle-free, and time-efficient, adding a touch of rainbow-themed magic to any celebration - perfect for effortless party planning! SUITABLE FOR ALL EVENTS: Our EpiqueOne Décor kit is perfect for creating a personalized backdrop that reflects your unique style and personality. Whether you're going for an elegant wedding, a fun birthday party, or a cute baby shower, our kit is completely customizable to fit any theme or color scheme of your choice. You can trust us to help you bring your vision to life and make your special occasion truly unforgettable with our delightful rainbow party decorations. RAINBOW REVELRY ESSENTIALS: This comprehensive kit includes 20 stunning tissue paper pom poms in two sizes (10x 10” and 10x 8”), 6 vibrant paper lanterns (8” each), and 3 rainbow honeycomb balls (8” each) that add a pop of color to your décor. The kit also comes with a confetti garland that spans 6.5 feet, creating a festive atmosphere for your event. Ideal for birthdays, weddings, or any other special occasion, this decoration kit has everything you need to create a fun and lively party. SIMPLE TO SET UP: The straightforward installation process for this kit ensures that anyone can decorate their space in a matter of minutes, without the need for professional assistance or specialized equipment. Save time and hassle with our easy-to-assemble party decorations; the tissue paper pom poms only take a few minutes to peel apart and fluff up, while our lightweight paper lanterns and honeycomb balls can be opened and assembled in seconds, leaving you more time to enjoy the party. EXCELLENT VALUE FOR YOUR MONEY: Our kit contains everything you need to transform your venue into a color-filled paradise without breaking the bank. Inside, you'll find vibrant paper fans, pom poms, lanterns, and honeycombs, all crafted from premium materials, ensuring a lasting and remarkable experience. Not only are these decorations reusable, but they also come with easy-to-follow instructions for a hassle-free setup. Choose EPIQUEONE for unforgettable events and remarkable value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81A04u56LGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EPIQUEONE","source_asin":"B0997Z53RD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0997Z53RD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0997Z53RD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
