window.products.push({"id":217536,"name":"Cosy House Collection Everyday 1500 Series Down Alternative Comforter - College Dorm Room Essentials - All Season, Stays Fresh & Clean - Soft, Breatha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41D4x0O047L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ULTRA-SOFT & COMFORTER - Our luxurious Everyday Comforter is filled with premium down alternative fill for that cloud-like, extra plush, breathable quality you need for a peaceful night's rest. Made with 100% microfiber polyester, this material is safe for sensitive skin and those prone to allergies.. It's time to cuddle up in this buttery-smooth bedding! Our silky-soft comforter pairs great with our Everyday Duvet Cover Set, also designed with your ultimate comfort in mind. STRONGER THAN COTTON - This luxury comforter's material is more durable and longer-lasting than the highest thread count Egyptian Cotton. It features a box-style stitching pattern with piped edges to secure the duvet cover insert in place, and to prevent clumping or shifting over time. Unlike most standard bedding, our super durable comforter will resist wrinkles, stains, fading, and odors. PERFECT FOR ALL SEASONS - This luxury hotel style quality comforter is like staying at a 5-star resort in your very own home. Our bedspread is thick yet lightweight, with a crisp and cozy feel to keep you cool and comfy during the summer and warm during the winter. You can also check out our Luxury Down Alternative Comforter made with a Bamboo Viscose and Microfiber blend for regulating body heat all night long. EASY CARE - Getting this satin-like bedding washed is a breeze. Our comforters are machine washable and dryer friendly. It's simple. Set the washing machine on gentle or delicate using cold water. For drying use tumble-dry on low temperature, or sun dry. You won't even break a sweat. Our duvet insert or standalone comforter stays fresher & cleaner for longer compared to other blankets and linens. PEACE OF MIND - You can shop with confidence with Cosy. With up to five color options to choose from, mindfully sourced fabrics perfect for any kind of sleeper, and a durable yet elegant design, we're sure this comforter will lull you into a peaceful slumber. If you don't absolutely love your Premium Down Alternative Comforter, we offer a 100% Satisfaction Guarantee paired with World-Class customer service. We care about our Cosy community and are here for you every step of the way.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41D4x0O047L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cosy House Collection","source_asin":"B076QV6DPB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217536","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076QV6DPB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076QV6DPB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
