window.products.push({"id":217633,"name":"HOME-X Bon Appetit Butter Dish with Lid, Butter Dish with Cover, White Dish for Stick of Butter, Chef Themed Dish, 6 ½” L x 3 ¼” W x 2 ¼”H, White Litt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GJvz4qnJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The HOME-X Bon Appetit Butter Dish is a standout piece when it comes to kitchen tools and dinnerware. This sturdy ceramic butter holder is a great way to keep your butter fresh for a longer period of time while shielding it from stray crumbs, specks of dust, or spillage. With its durable bottom tray and cover lid, this butter tray keeps your butter contained, clean, and fresh. It is beautifully designed with cursive lettering that says \"Bon Appetit\" with a chef figurine on top of the lid. If you are a collector, this adorable dish is sure to make a great addition to your French-themed kitchen. The black and white colors coordinate well with any decorative design or style, from farmhouse to modern. The removable lid makes it easy to keep an eye on the amount of butter in the dish, so you’ll never need to worry about running out. Its compact size means that it won’t take up excessive kitchen counter or table space; it’s easy to transport and fits easily in your cabinet or on the table. It’s made with durable ceramic and built to withstand regular use. The enclosed cover makes it easy to carry it back and forth between the kitchen, dining room, or any eating spot you choose. To clean, simply wash by hand with soap and warm water. This butter keeper also makes the perfect gift for the friend or family member who is difficult to shop for. It’s a creative gift they’ll be sure to appreciate and put to good use. Whether you decide to gift it or use it in your own home, we know you’ll love the HOME-X Bon Appetit Butter Dish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GJvz4qnJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B08HQV42SX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HQV42SX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HQV42SX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
