window.products.push({"id":217660,"name":"Lower South Falls, Silver Falls State Park, Oregon Giclee Archival Canvas Print Wall Art Décor for Home & Office from Photograph by Steve Terrill 30\" ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1U3Q5KnCrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Photographer Steve Terrill is a native of Portland, Oregon. His career began in 1980 when he was hired as a staff photographer by Beautiful America Publishing. Weeks later, his career literally exploded when he captured the eruption of Mt. St Helens on 18 May, 1980. The photos were seen worldwide; one of them was even presented to President Jimmy Carter. He has trekked and photographed throughout the United States. However, his main focus has been the great Pacific Northwest where he has sought to preserve on film the grandeur of nature. His work has been featured in countless books, calendars, and magazines including publications by Audubon, National Geographic, Sierra Club, National Wildlife, Outdoor Photographer, Travel & Leisure and more. All canvas art prints are professionally printed in the United States on high-quality, archival-grade, thick satin canvas, and stretched with real poplar wood bars for guaranteed stability. We use Greenguard Gold certified archival art inks that generate intense, rich colors that are true to the artist’s vision and original creation. The ink is also scientifically certified to meet some of the world’s most rigorous third-party chemical emissions standards, helping to reduce indoor air pollution and the risk of chemical exposure. The time and care put into producing your canvas art print will make it a tremendous wall art décor addition to your kitchen, bedroom, family room, office, or even dorm room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1U3Q5KnCrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Art of Place","source_asin":"B07WHLFJSN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WHLFJSN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WHLFJSN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":217661,"name":"Toothbrush Pillow - Toothbrush Holder and Toothbrush Stabilizer for Easy Application of Toothpaste","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QDWLbmDPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The toothbrush pillow is a toothbrush holder and stabilizer and was created to provide everyone a simple solution to stabilize their toothbrush for easy application of toothpaste. Everyone brushes their teeth, but for some it's not an easy task. Toothbrush pillow provides a horizontal holder to allow a person to concentrate on applying toothpaste without the mess and frustration. It also has a vertical holder to allow a toothbrush to dry hygienically. People that have found our product useful are those that live with limb differences, down syndrome, special needs, arthritis, Parkinson's, stroke, and upper limb amputee. Toothbrush and toothpaste are not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QDWLbmDPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Toothbrush Pillow","source_asin":"B01LYFLY4D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LYFLY4D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LYFLY4D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
