window.products.push({"id":217696,"name":"REACHER Small Wireless Charging Alarm Clock with Dimmable Digital LED Display, Easy to Use, Plug in Simple Clock for Bedroom, Bedside, Office (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EQEQVYApL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect phone companion! It's easier to place your phone onto it than to fumble around with the cord in a dim light, and you don't have to unplug your phone to make/answer calls. Wireless Charging Compatible Most Universal Mobile Phone： For iPhone 13/13 Pro/13 Pro Max/12/12 Pro/12 Pro Max/ SE (2020)/11/11 Pro/11 Pro Max/XS/XS Max/XR/X/8 Plus/8（NOTE: iPhone 7 or older models are not compatible） For Samsung Galaxy S21 /S20 / S10 / S9+ / S9 / S8 / S8+ / S7 edge / S7 / S6 edge+ For Samsung Note 20 / Note 10 / Note 9 / Note 8 / Note 7 Other Universal Smartphone Models May Apply: Such as: Google Nexus 4/5/6/7, etc. Please Note: 5W Mode: Using 5V, 1.2A Adapter（Including） 7.5W/10W Mode: Using 9V, 2A Adapter （NOT Including） Worry-free too bright at night Adjust the brightness to what you desire with 6-level dimmer button. Easy to read in day, and not disturb your sleep at night, for those night light sensitive can adjust display light to super dim. Multi-protection Multi functional intelligent protect technology provides overcharge protection, and short-circuit prevention to your phone, extending battery life.You can purchase it with confidence. Phone Case-friendly Supports Charges directly through phone protective cases less than 5 mm thick only. Note phone cases made of metal, attachments such as pop sockets, metal rings, magnets, cards, grips will interfere with charging. Easy to Use Just place your phone on the wireless charger for charging, no more need to plug and unplug. Make sure your phone on the center of the Wireless Charging Pad to ensure stable charging. Power Source Alarm clock with wireless charging is outlet powered. Plug in for daily use. 3 AAA batteries (not including)for maintaining all settings and enables all functions except wireless charging your phone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EQEQVYApL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REACHER","source_asin":"B0B7LGRZ6M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7LGRZ6M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7LGRZ6M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
