window.products.push({"id":217698,"name":"Cordless Roman Shades Window Shades, Grey Blackout Light Filtering Window Roman Blinds, Custom Linen Blend Fabric Roman Shades for Windows, French Doo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nRyE7FvGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Benefits and Features Fresh and Fabulous Fabric The Roman Shade brings together a beautiful array of colors, patterns, and textures that are sure to please. High quality and exclusively sourced, these shades add a touch of elegance to any room. Control Type Two lift controls can be paired with your window treatments.  Metal chain cord, smooth operation with a consistent cord length makes raising shades easier than ever, even for large, heavy shades.  Cordless roman shades simply pull up or down on the shade by spring system. The ball on the bottom help you control the shade and avoid touching to keep the shade clean. Light/Privacy Roman Shades are constructed from a range of high-quality fabrics that provide varying levels of light control and privacy.  Sheer Roman Shade enables a view to the outside with minimal privacy.  Light Filtering Unlined Roman Shade allows light to gently filter through for some privacy.  Blackout with beige liner on the back, Blocks 85-95% natural light for privacy. Custom made to your specification Get your custom roman shades step by step.  1. Choose Inside or Outside Mount 2. Choose Width, for inside mount, choose the exact inside window width, for outside mount, choose exact shade width you need 3. Choose Height, for inside mount, choose the exact inside window height, for outside mount, choose exact shade height you need 4. Input your exact window size in order to double check the size you choose is correct or not 5. Finish other custom option then place the order We provide various custom roman shades, fabric roman shades, cordless roman shades, white roman shades, grey roman shades, black roman shade, floral roman shades, blackout roman shades, room darkening roman shades, thermal roman shades, sheer roman shades, linen roman shades for windows, French door, kitchen windows, doors, bathroom, bay windows.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nRyE7FvGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grneric","source_asin":"B08FD5BGBR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217698","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FD5BGBR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FD5BGBR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":217699,"name":"Oriental Furniture 9\" Foo Dog Statues (Set of Two)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":71.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zYe-gVP-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These exceptionally detailed statues are a mirrored pair of Chinese Foo Dogs on traditional pediments. Fu dogs are said to be rendered from the descriptions Taoist and Buddhist artists heard of great lions, creatures not native to the Far East. Mythical creatures considered auspicious in traditional Chinese and Japanese Buddhist art and iconography, thought to ward off bad influences and to keep safe the good souls in their charge. Finding unique and interesting interior design accents is not the easiest part of decorating a room, but it is fun, and crucial to turning a house or apartment into a home of one's own. Fu dogs are thought to bring good luck.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zYe-gVP-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORIENTAL Furniture","source_asin":"B003ZJ0T2M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217699","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003ZJ0T2M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003ZJ0T2M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
