window.products.push({"id":217827,"name":"Milk Frother Handheld for Cappuccinos, Lattes and Bulletproof Coffee, Foam Maker Drink Mixer with More Powerful High Torque Motor (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41PCx9JJ6xL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This is a convenient milk frother to help you enjoy premium, barista-quality beverages and whipped toppings from the comfort of your own home. Top Features: ◆ Amazing Frother Power: Creates Creamy Milk Foam in Seconds !◆ EASY To USE: Easy one-touch operation, simply press the On/Off button to start frothing.◆ Easy-clean : To deep clean, just turn the frother on and dip the whisk in hot soapy water,then rinse .◆ HIGH QUALITY: Durable stainless steel whisk and lightweight plastic handle for comfortable operation . Usage Tips: 1. Put the coffee frappe mixer into a container with drinks up to approx. 1/3 to start frothing.2. Press and hold down the ON/OFF switch, the whisk will start to run and make foam.3. As soon as the milk froth starts forming, lift the appliance slightly so that it always in the froth layer.4. When the milk is frothy enough, let stop the whisk running.5. Please remember to take your finger off the ON/OFF switch before lifting the whisk out of the milk to avoid spraying the liquid everywhere.6. If you would like to make hot milk froth, the temperature of the milk should not be over 60℃/140℉, otherwise, the milk will not froth up perfectly. Specifications： Material: 304 Stainless steel + ABS plasticDimension: 21*3.9 cm / 8.3*1.5 inchsProduct Weight: 0.15 kgs / 0.33 ibsPackage:Gift Carton 💕Please remember we offer 100% exchange and refund service. If you have any problems, please CONTACT US by email. We will reply you within 4 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41PCx9JJ6xL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DASHQI","source_asin":"B081TFNX15","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217827","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081TFNX15","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081TFNX15","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
