window.products.push({"id":217903,"name":"[A&S Crystals] AMETHYST BOWL Natural Stone Hand Carved Gemstone Bowl [44]","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61INcXKO5mL._AC_SL1150_.jpg","description":"ABOUT AMETHYST Amethyst is a very powerful and protective stone. It is often called the “Stone of Sobriety” due to its common use in helping overcome various addictions. Amethyst is a natural stress reliever and encourages inner strength. Amethyst has a strong healing energy that can transmute lower vibrations to higher frequencies and can transform negative energy to positive. Amethyst has a peaceful, loving energy and helps with developing intuition and psychic abilities. Amethyst activates the Crown Chakra to enhance spiritual awareness and promote a higher state of consciousness. Amethyst clears and repairs holes in the aura and draws in Divine energy. Amethyst is also often used help to alleviate headaches and migraines as well as to dispel nightmares and help with insomni ABOUT CRYSTAL BOWLS Crystal bowls are commonly used on their own, to charge the items placed within or as an alter or offering bowl.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61INcXKO5mL._AC_SL1150_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A and S Crystal Company","source_asin":"B01H7EBLY0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217903","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H7EBLY0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H7EBLY0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":217904,"name":"Personalized Graduation Gift For Girl Women Jewelry Box Engraved Glass Keepsake High School Graduate College Grad Class Of 2023 Daughter Granddaughter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91W5mxFF3kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Personalized graduation gifts make lifetime keepsakes. Do you need a graduation gift for her? The Class of 2020 are about to walk into their future. Give a glass jewelry box personalized for your college, high school or middle school graduate. Personalize this glass box with 3 lines of type. Lettering will be engraved and will appear in white frost on the beveled glass top. Embracing the arts and crafts style this colorful stained glass box features a clear glass embossed with a vintage texture and accented with shades of turquoise blue, green, peach and purple. Clear iridescent glass in the bottom shimmers with color when you open the lid. Decorative metal edging on the hinged lid, round ball feet and a chain on the inside that supports the top when it is open are all part of the quality detailing. Use as a jewelry display case, ring dish, or a keepsake box for precious trinkets. It’s a decorative and functional gift for a girl or woman of any age. All J Devlin products are made with lead free solder to protect you and the environment. The metal trim and solder have also been stained with an antique charcoal patina and a wax applied to this glass box keeping it beautiful for years to come. Polish with a soft dry cloth if necessary. Each stained glass box is carefully handcrafted by skilled artisans using a copper foil and solder technique developed by Louis Comfort Tiffany in the late 1800’s. This age-old art form combined with 21st century designs creates the perfect combination for unique home décor. J Devlin has been designing and manufacturing quality glass home decor since 1999. Please enjoy this exclusive and original design. Give as a gift or add to your own wish list today!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91W5mxFF3kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"J Devlin Glass Art","source_asin":"B07Y45HG1L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217904","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y45HG1L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y45HG1L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":217905,"name":"TYPEWRITER","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VBMjclTBL._AC_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VBMjclTBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EJPJMQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217905","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EJPJMQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EJPJMQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
