window.products.push({"id":217932,"name":"Leakproof Reusable Storage Bags, FDA Grade Bags Extra Thick Snack Lunch Bag-BPA FREE Ziplock Bag for Food Storage, Make-up Travel Home Organization (3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gvJ5P+YHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Saving our earth !!! According to relevant scientific reports, humans have produced 18.2 trillion pounds (about 8.26 billion tons) of plastics, and most of these plastics have become garbage. Most plastics are not capable of any meaningful biodegradation, meaning that human-made plastic waste can exist for hundreds or even thousands of years. In our environment, there is almost no place without plastic waste, including the ocean. Our mission is to reduce the use of disposable plastic bag, provide people with convenient, collapsible, reusable PEVA storage bags. WHY US? ❤ Our storage bags are made of food-grade & eco-friendly PEVA material, PVC-free, lead-free & chloride-free, a biodegradable and recyclable material that is not harmful to the environment when disposed of or burned. They are healthy and safe. Extra thick material makes it durable. ❤ The ziplock baggies are leakproof, air tight closures design make bags more leakproof that can keep food FRESH for longer.. Ideal for food storage. ❤8.5 x 7.2 inch (22 x 18 cm),snack bag is 8.5 x 4.7 inch (22 x 11.5 cm). Perfect size for lunch bag. Packs reusable ziplock bags set can save more than 500 disposable baggies, perfect solution for plastic bag waste reduction. ❤ No environmentally hazardous colors added to the storage bags for ECO friendly purpose. Transparent design allows for a quick glance at the contents inside. ❤ Multi Functional: They are perfect for jewelry make-up, snacks, Sandwiches, Food storage, Veggies, Chips, Baby Pacifiers, Stationery travel and much more. Choose our reusable storage bags, save you money and save the earth. Note: ⚠️No microwave - Heat will cause the bags to warp⚠️No hot food⚠️No dishwasher Handwash with room temperature or cool water, and leave to air dry. For best results, leave the bags open over a cup overnight to dry","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gvJ5P+YHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"pestor","source_asin":"B07S8SWGBN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217932","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S8SWGBN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S8SWGBN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
