window.products.push({"id":217937,"name":"AIYXIN Ice Cream Scoop Set,Comfortable Handle Stainless Steel Cookie Scoop with Trigger,Double-Sided Melon Baller Tool Fruit Scoop, Seed Remover Cupca","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51K3uDNFkqL._AC_.jpg","description":"Multipurpose kitchen utensil: Maybe cookies aren’t your thing? Don’t let that stop you from putting our stainless steel scoop to use, there are endless opportunities for use including rice balls, frozen yogurt, cupcakes, vegetable purees, sherbets, popovers, canapes, mashed potato, patties, muffins, sauces and puddings, peanut butter, chocolate spread, butter and more. Multipurpose Trigger Scoop: This ice cream spoon set is not just an ice cream spoon, it can also be used to make delicious cookies, cupcakes, muffins, fruit platter and more. Really a multi-purpose kitchen appliance. Instructions: 1.With secondary polishing, H-Min metal ice cream scoop have gleaming surface. The beautiful look will be a hot addition to your kitchen. 2. Digging the ice cream: Scrap the surface of the prepared ice cream directly and scrape it into the ball digger, then squeeze the handle with your hand to make a ball. At the end of the scraping, turn the ball digger sideways, so that the ice cream dug out should be round. 3. Digging fruit balls: Watermelon, dragon fruit, papaya and other fruits can be directly pressed into the ball digger, and then pinched to form. How to Dig Ice Cream Correctly: Cover the ice cream with plastic wrap and leave it at room temperature (recommended in the refrigerator in summer). Return to temperature for about half an hour before digging the balls to enjoy. Tips: If your ice cream just comes out of the freezer and looks like a brick, it's not easy to take off. Because ice cream freezes easily in a spoon, it can become toothed if forced to clamp.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51K3uDNFkqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIYXIN","source_asin":"B08CTBXQFX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217937","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CTBXQFX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CTBXQFX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
