window.products.push({"id":217954,"name":"TOPGREEN All-Season Down Alternative Comforter King - Fluffy 100% Cotton Fabric & Ultra-Soft Cloud Breathable GRS Bio-Based Microfiber Filling Quilted","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51htwchHQDL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"You'll Be Smiling All Day Thanks To A Snug Night'S Sleep Under This Top-factory-Quality Down-Alternative Comforter. ●The all-season comforter is filled with 275GSM super-soft microfiber, Proper weight, and no pressure. Advanced moisture-wicking & absorption, offers you baby-sleep like on a cloud in both warmer and cooler months. Add Beauty to Your Home ●Top factory quality comforter holds up to wear and tear, prevents shrinkage and wrinkles. ●Box stitched and well distributed, with no concern for or shifting clumping filling. It will guarantee you a restful, tranquil, and comfortable night. ●The simple and elegant designs can work as a duvet insert or a stand-alone white comforter. Lightweight and breathable, warm at the same time, perfect for year-round use. Care Properly For Your All Season Comforter And It Will Recharge You For Many Years To Come. ● The fluffy comforter arrives in vacuumed packaging, upon receipt, please spread it for several hours to recover the fluffy. ● Machine wash in the gentle cycle with cold water, air dry, or tumble dry on low heat setting when needed. Do not bleach, Do not iron. TOPGREEN Constantly Aims To Make Tomorrow Better. ● TOPGREEN has an international standard home textile factory of over 3000 square meters and has been focusing on the production of bedding products for many years. And we have been looking for a variety of ways to improve our products, Our goods compete in terms of product quality, reliability and above all comfort.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51htwchHQDL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOPGREEN","source_asin":"B08ZNKPC1N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZNKPC1N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZNKPC1N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
