window.products.push({"id":217969,"name":"Kivik Toddler Weighted Blanket for Kids 3 lbs 36x48,Dinosaur Weighted Blanket for Boys and Girls,Childrens Heavy Blanket for Calming and Sleep,Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EaAVN8I8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fun Design: Weighted throw blanket measures 36x48 inches and weighs 3 pounds, best for 20-40 pounds children individual use.Add a touch of decorative enchantment to your kids room and warm comfort with kivik blue dinosaur weighted blanket.Fancy and vivid design features their favorite animal cartoon.Blanket provides kids with a gentle feeling of being hugged. Safe for Children: For the safety and comfort of children,this weighted blanket is made of breathable like cotton fabric,padded with fine glass beads that are non-toxic,lead-free,and antimagnetic.5-layer structure and strong stitching prevent beads leaking or shifting during sleep.Attach it to a duvet cover through the 8 securing loops on the edge to use throughout the year. Restful Whole Night Sleep: Do your children have sleeping troubles and you are fed up of putting them into bed? Well, Kivik kids weighted blankets can facilitate kids sleep with constant cuddle-like tight hug, which will calm them down when they are excited for a tight sleep. Great Gift: This animal kids weighted blanket will make any child smile and will make watching tv, reading a book, or snuggling on the couch more comfortable. Child must be age 3 or older. Weighted Blanket should be no more than 10% of the child's weight. Please note that it takes 2-7 days to get used to the weight of the blanket. Easy Care and Trustworthy Customer Service:Launder the blanket in machine with cold water and air dry.We dedicate to building a brand that brings value and comfortable living to our customers. Any problems with our product, please do contact us. All our products enjoy lifetime warranty so you can buy with confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EaAVN8I8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kivik","source_asin":"B09T3BTLFF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217969","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T3BTLFF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T3BTLFF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
