window.products.push({"id":217989,"name":"LAYUKI Toilet Brush and Holder Set, Silicone Bristles Brush Head, Long Aluminium Alloy Handle, Freestanding or Wall Mount, White & Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eGWVK6byL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High-Quality Silicone Bristles】LAYUKI’s toilet bowl brush head is made of thicker and stronger silicone rubber bristles, which makes it much easier to remove the stains at the bottom and edge of the rim. The brush head is also washable by rinsing. 【Longer & Anti-rust Handle】 LAYUKI’s toilet bowl brush has a 17.7\" rod which is longer than the most toilet brush. The longer rod gives you great control and keeps your hands away from sewage. The upgraded rod is made of anti-rust aluminum alloy and is more sanitary than plastic materials. 【Well-ventilated Slot Holder】LAYUKI’s toilet cleaner has a compact slot holder, which was designed with a receiver to collect the rest water and with several holes to make the brush well-ventilated. 【Free Standing or Wall-Mounted Installation】LAYUKI’s toilet brush and holder set with a stable base can be placed just on the floor freely. It’s also can be wall mounted by using the self-adhesive tape packaged in. Please kindly be reminded that the self-adhesive tape is only applicable to the smooth surfaces. 【Compact & Clean Looking】LAYUKI’s toilet brush with holder is designed compact and simple with the color of white and gray, it also keeps your bathroom clean and nice-looking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eGWVK6byL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAYUKI","source_asin":"B0BBF9Z11Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBF9Z11Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBF9Z11Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
