window.products.push({"id":217996,"name":"FHE Group Tissue Rug Bath Mat, 45 by 27 Inches, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BqWZ5p-7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The soft texture of the tissue rug pampers your feet after a bath or shower View larger The underside of the tissue rug shows the quality weaving that holds it all together and provides long-lasting durability View larger The FHE Group's inspiring and enticing tissue rug will bring a fresh new look to your bathroom floors and beyond. Luxuriant and Long-Lasting Handcrafted in India and made from recycled blended cotton, FHE’s tissue rug offers a full, plush texture that you'll find incredibly soft and comfortable to step on. And even though it has a charming, delicate appearance, the high-quality tissue rug can handle daily foot traffic with the utmost resiliency. Flexible and Fun The tissue rug works well not only as a comfy bath mat on cold, hard bathroom floors but also as a distinctive accent rug in bedrooms, family rooms, and front entrances. Or bring color and cushioning to areas where you do a lot of standing, like kitchens and laundry rooms. The fun and fluffy appearance also makes the tissue rug a perfect fit in any child’s room or a college dorm room. Fits Your Décor This versatile rug comes in two sizes — 30 inches by 20 inches and 45 inches by 27 inches — and a large selection of neutral-to-bright colors. No Fuss, No Muss Upkeep is simple and easy: Toss the tissue rug in the washer for cleaning, put it in the tumble dryer to fluff it up, and the rug will look new again--no dry cleaning or special service required. The rug's name comes from its resemblance to delicate tissue paper, but you'll find it easily handles daily wear with no-fuss care View larger Distinctive Design The FHE Group's mission is to create fresh, contemporary home accents with superior value and quality. The tissue bath rug embodies this ethos with its stunning appearance and texture that adds a \"wow\" factor wherever you use it without sacrificing durability and reliability. The tissue rug will bring delight to your eyes and your feet every day. Key Features Made from incredibly soft but highly durable cotton Made from incredibly soft but highly durable cotton Two sizes: 30 inches by 20 inches and 45 inches by 27 inches Two sizes: 30 inches by 20 inches and 45 inches by 27 inches Easy care--just toss in the washer to clean, then dry and fluff in the dryer Easy care--just toss in the washer to clean, then dry and fluff in the dryer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BqWZ5p-7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The FHE Group","source_asin":"B00GD4JLKW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-217996","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GD4JLKW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GD4JLKW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
